 "notes": [
  "Four reported segments: India Multi-channel (FirstCry online + FirstCry/BabyHug stores in India, own manufacturing of home brands, FirstCry Intellitots preschools are NOT here), International (FirstCry UAE and KSA), Globalbees (D2C brand roll-up, 51.68% owned) and Others (preschools / education).",
  "Inter-segment = consolidated revenue (or adjusted EBITDA) less the sum of the four segments: sales between segments (e.g. home brands sold to International and Globalbees brands sold on FirstCry).",
  "Adjusted EBITDA (company) = EBITDA before share-based pay, deal costs and Ind AS 103 B55 employment cost, after exceptional items are removed; it is on the Ind AS 116 basis, so store and warehouse rent sits in depreciation and interest, not in EBITDA. Reported EBITDA (Screener operating profit) = adjusted EBITDA less ESOP cost (less B55 cost in FY24-FY25).",
  "GMV = consolidated India multi-channel + International GMV (FirstCry website, apps and stores incl. franchisees, gross of discounts and taxes, before returns). Globalbees and Others are not in GMV. India/International split published from FY25 in the Q4FY26 deck; FY23-FY24 split not found (gap).",
  "Stores = FirstCry modern stores (FOFO franchise + COCO) at period end."
 ],
